And Ica had a boyfriend who was a Arrow Cross Nazi.

And one of my cousin, one of my cousin, who lives in Budapest, and he is celebrating this year the 101st birthday, he was also visiting and he talked to that guy, and he told him, "You just stay put. Don't do anything." You know? "You just protect the property of the Highnesses, make no waves. And after the war, there's a trial. They're going to testify that you were a good boy." So he didn't do anything. And we recovered the furniture, the linens, the piano. Everything was the same as before.

And I am sorry that I never-- I did not get involved in trying to... [SNEEZING] ...getting a tree growing in Israel... [PAUSES] ...in honor of Ica. But maybe I can still do it.

