She organized a policeman. She got the Arrow Cross. She got the papers done properly. She was the-- Sister picked me up at the school to bring me to the Swedish house. It's amazing. Amazing. Yeah. And became a-- And we believe that we were liberated. The Hungarian people did not consider it a liberation. They considered it occupation.

